<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Paragon Trade cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Paragon Trade cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it downgraded Paragon Trade Brands Inc to near-term neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- said cut the long-term rating to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Paragon Trade lost 3/4 to to 15-5/8.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
